      "message": "Hey Todd, Alistair: Here\u0027s an initial pass for the hikey960 patches for android12-5.10\n\nMost of these are forward ported versions of what was in android12-5.4, though some have been reworked.\n\nEverything is hikey960 specific (with the exception of the adv7511 patch, which was also in android12-5.4) so there should be little risk to other platforms.\n\nI have to follow-on patches at the end that improve reliability of dwc3, I\u0027m still pushing those upstream and they aren\u0027t strictly necessary, but are helpful for my testing.\n\n\nIn addition to this we need a android12-5.10 branch for the hikey-modules project, which requires a few extra build fixes over the android12-5.4 branch of the same.\n",
